    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c67ae0066acbfbf89fb3bfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……小、小目的特辑铺天盖地。\n封面、还有卷首特辑、全都是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c257b4b8a5e83f3d67ea60f5ce4529d34009ac896ae7c80bd6d70f37f5e02cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
