      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa09d10f0d946574597159df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们来INPUT（输入）吧！\n既然小目如此深入民心，\n那就把她的秘诀弄到手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dc02ba671c8f41e5542f7017c201b1e9a384652c7e9c12e2a8e6193807ad4ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2d70bba9d1a6fa3c673240",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业",
      "source_fingerprint": "724792a2e3d296c7611773ef019203633319ea51a39af196ebd8de8dbc3c2a42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399d2f1e95b2e601f34d5920",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定要找出答案！\n她究竟做了什么，能超越我的宝冢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e5798be87d18392162023c78b1f396272d5c58091288dc6f2531b54ff41d09e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:352b814b1284bb3b23fe5931",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――杏目。\n战绩是5战4胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e205bb01033e023dbb2e5f8a3ec65c81994fb25cea49c9c0343b9c10f37fc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cccb106982fecfee2d0a0b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在『樱花赏』的直道上连超15名赛马娘。\n连第1人气的经典级女王旺紫丁\n也被她击败，一举夺魁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed7a43c24732a745c21e959cd60e136f75507adacaaacb5d811322793d4b2a28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf9994b9baab132d7046960",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后出战『日本橡树大赛』\n在最后三浪……最终600m\n跑出本场最快的33.2秒轻松取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c4bc9275c1ff4ffc9929d112bc1008abb77ad54dc96db87abcba42cc94763c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b85f2101576259b1b9ffa41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个成绩连参加同年同赛场・同距离的\n『日本德比』的赛马娘也难以企及，\n彰显出压倒性的速度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b32d250c8a660170ac453f45491f0ea7f8d46fbc527e328177dcaf85a0cc96f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b18ef3cc3364b2a4122177c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "堪称传奇的序幕――\n杏目就是有着这样的成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc1d0c80acfcb5de0bbb164699c816a87ea9d8a60e18d3ca8a32f9247455618",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
