    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a6f59c4ca2b401c2e1ed46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……呜、好耀眼――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4ebd62d8211a6b988ff5eb8ce34e6265261833500181a61284a02fdaca32089",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:649be0289e7320fa4e547e83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和神业一起，\n把杏目的情报事无巨细地调查了一遍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc233c1b5b3637ba3746fcc0936e00866b6548e4176feef99f5a1984a1f1ef7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a8b766b064fd716548d9cee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……呜、这个赛马娘太强了……――）",
      "source_fingerprint": "71552fd2f78fdd2007fdabe3015c11051f87f214516df244783843b9d5172301",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3676f1ff62d21e89519a141e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而每一次的情报分析\n都让我们愈发清晰地认识到……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e4579a76cc3c2ab451b97606d40eb29e7084a36092bd2cc64b253eb25bf4ba5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d7be6b45289a5676b0c35e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业",
      "source_fingerprint": "724792a2e3d296c7611773ef019203633319ea51a39af196ebd8de8dbc3c2a42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
