      "uid": "zhcn:25acdf9ce113e85a99d6519f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……转眼间、\n大家的心都被小目给――……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936bbbef441bb849fc9d1a3d35d56fc7cc138b14f8e345a5c455a3522f9905e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
