    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd69131d4b958c92803f274",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是神业朝着眼前的目标\n『秋古马三冠』燃起了熊熊斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bff52dea4d4bb80d56c306cfda3725b4c47346cd989513d3d65df5c5dcdf13a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
