      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5389357982521cbaa033604c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这份心愿的最大阻碍，\n是和我一样奋力向着那个位置发起冲击的\n像神业同学那样的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97bf082fa62919d5196fdd842123787d62c19300fd30d8ca240489e2c7cf896d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2249a036189bd75901bdf1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先要全力地投入到夏季集训的特训中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c00c74ba5fe9c81081fe0fea3f93a0c0dcfcb597f104b803f92c9fef0ba71150",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
